# Amazon dataset — supplied locally, never committed.
#
# Neither file is redistributed here: the license and redistribution terms of
# the source dataset have not been verified, and the raw source additionally
# contains 9,269 real reviewer ids and names. Both are developer-supplied:
#   src/amazon.csv             raw source, downloaded by the developer
#   public/amazon-products.csv generated from it via `npm run build:amazon`
# See "Amazon dataset" in README.md for where to get it and where to put it.
src/amazon.csv
public/amazon-products.csv

# Benchmark raw output — timestamped run files, regenerated on demand.
# The committed record is bench/DECISION.md; raw runs would bury it in noise.
# Runs against the local Amazon dataset also derive from ungitignored source data.
bench/results/

# Acceptance-gate artifacts: regenerable, bulky, and duplicate dataset text.
# The durable record is bench/GATE.md.
bench/gate/
